{"id":"32edbcb806014788","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-expression-grammar-precedence.md","title":"表达式的原始文法与优先级文法","display":"df-expression-grammar-precedence — 表达式的原始文法与优先级文法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence","aliases":["73-df-expression-grammar-precedence"],"display":"df-expression-grammar-precedence — 表达式的原始文法与优先级文法","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4.1–5.4.2, Figures 5.17–5.19, print pp. 207–212; PDF pp. 229–234; identifier-token abstraction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-expression-grammar-precedence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expression-grammar-precedence — 表达式的原始文法与优先级文法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4.1–5.4.2, Figures 5.17–5.19, print pp. 207–212; PDF pp. 229–234; identifier-token abstraction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma|=5\">\\(|\\Sigma|=5\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,T,F\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(E,T,F\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span> 为三个互异变量。每个产生式右部是显式有限词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_a\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},E\\rangle),(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{*},E\\rangle),\n(E,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(E,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_a\\coloneqq(\\{E\\},\\Sigma,P_a,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_a\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},E\\rangle),(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{*},E\\rangle),\n(E,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(E,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_a\\coloneqq(\\{E\\},\\Sigma,P_a,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_u\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},T\\rangle),(E,\\langle T\\rangle),\n(T,\\langle T,\\mathtt{*},F\\rangle),(T,\\langle F\\rangle),\n(F,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(F,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_u\\coloneqq(\\{E,T,F\\},\\Sigma,P_u,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_u\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},T\\rangle),(E,\\langle T\\rangle),\n(T,\\langle T,\\mathtt{*},F\\rangle),(T,\\langle F\\rangle),\n(F,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(F,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_u\\coloneqq(\\{E,T,F\\},\\Sigma,P_u,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>i 是一个标识符记号，略去了教材中标识符内部的正则生成层；该明确的词法抽象不影响算术运算符歧义。E 层只引入加号，T 层引入乘号，左递归固定左结合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma|=5","display":false},{"tex":"E,T,F\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_a\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},E\\rangle),(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{*},E\\rangle),\n(E,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(E,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_a\\coloneqq(\\{E\\},\\Sigma,P_a,E).","display":true},{"tex":"P_u\\coloneqq\\{(E,\\langle E,\\mathtt{+},T\\rangle),(E,\\langle T\\rangle),\n(T,\\langle T,\\mathtt{*},F\\rangle),(T,\\langle F\\rangle),\n(F,\\langle\\mathtt{(},E,\\mathtt{)}\\rangle),(F,\\langle\\mathtt i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nG_u\\coloneqq(\\{E,T,F\\},\\Sigma,P_u,E).","display":true}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-expression-grammar-precedence|表达式的原始文法与优先级文法]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"3e8ad15153e3cb59","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G_a,G_u,\\Sigma$ 见 [[73-df-expression-grammar-precedence]]；$w=\\langle\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt i\\rangle$。"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}